mac-trackpad
============

accel/mac_curves.py implements the macOS parametric acceleration curve.
The curve's shape and units (polynomial, linear tangent, square-root
falloff; device speed divided by resolution/67, output scaled by 96/67)
were learned from WebKit's ScrollingAccelerationCurve.cpp. The momentum
decay used later in this project is modelled on WebKit's
MomentumEventDispatcher.cpp. No code was copied; credited here because
the behaviour comes from there:

